    "turn_text": "When you say all year, you take us back to last September or August when school would have started, of us knew at that time whether this would be a two year, one year, three year. We're in the middle of this thing that none of us has a playbook for, never seen this before. So you didn't start out the school year thinking we're going to go right back to polling everybody and doing it in person if they want. Surely you held off for a while.",
